  "description": "The pipeline behaviors of CQRSharp (validation, exception handling, logging, rate limiting, resilience, timeouts, idempotency with result replay, and the unit of work) and ICqrsBuilder, the fluent builder AddCqrsGenerated(b => ...) configures, including the outbox and idempotency store choice. The builder registers validation and exception handling by default; every other behavior runs only when its verb is called.",
